# Gameplan

Reads the committed gameplan and workstreams; uses the CLI's own status marks
([x] done, [>] in progress, [ ] pending) so the TUI and CLI read the same.

@compact
┌────────────────────────────────┐
│ Gameplan            p1 · 10/23 │
├────────────────────────────────┤
│ [>] T-e5  local backends       │
│ [>] T-e20 palace tree-sitter   │
│ [ ] T-e6  housekeeping         │
│ [ ] T-e10 planner drops reqs   │
└────────────────────────────────┘
note: in-progress first, then pending in plan order; done is hidden.

